{
  "name": "divergences",
  "why": "What api/display.py actually does with each schema-invalid document, observed by running it. web/lib/verdict.ts refuses all of them; this table is the record of what it is refusing that the Python does not, and it exists because a hand-written list of the same thing was wrong three times",
